No game assets, executables, extracted or decrypted images, generated translations, keys or
other data from Ghost Recon Advanced Warfighter are distributed here. Tools operate on the
user's own copy and their outputs stay local: .gitignore keeps them out, and
tools/audit_repo.py checks every commit. tools/xex_basic_decrypt.py needs a key the user
supplies; none is included.

